flowchart TD
  C[Client / checkout] -- "POST /payments<br/>Idempotency-Key" --> API[Payment API]
  API --> PS[Payment service<br/>state machine]
  PS --> DB[(Payments · ledger · outbox<br/>one database transaction)]
  PS -- "charge (our idempotency key)" --> PSP[Payment provider<br/>cards · UPI]
  PSP -- signed webhooks --> WH[Webhook handler<br/>verify · dedupe]
  WH --> PS
  DB -. outbox relay .-> K{{Kafka}}
  K --> O[Orders · notifications · analytics]
  REC[Reconciliation job] --> DB
  PSP -- settlement files --> REC
